    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφθαρσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>simultaneous destruction</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν μιγνυμένων ἄλλου τινὸς γεννωμένου
					σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Mixt.</u>
					216.24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Meno
				<u>Iatr.</u>
				14.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>melting into one another</i>, (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν
				ἰδεῶν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.80
			</span></i> P.</div>
